{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your team have booked a cozy hotel for the night, but something feels off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As soon as you step into the elevator, you notice it malfunctioning. Is this hotel really <u>safe</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect items to navigate the Hotel of Horror and Abyss. Work with your team, communicate, help each other, and most importantly\u2014<u>stay alive</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every word matters with <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to escape the current floor while avoiding certain <strong>entities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert to your surroundings... even those you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>roguelike</strong> game where you collect coins to purchase cosmetics and other upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character customization included.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548760?t=1742822323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/d10cc4a8d7819d7d107d7cfbe60359d44d51fc62/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742822323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/97c8f006a078f4714302590dd9a2872dd0dddc86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742822323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/97c8f006a078f4714302590dd9a2872dd0dddc86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742822323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your team have booked a cozy hotel for the night, but something feels off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As soon as you step into the elevator, you notice it malfunctioning. Is this hotel really <u>safe</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect items to navigate the Hotel of Horror and Abyss. Work with your team, communicate, help each other, and most importantly\u2014<u>stay alive</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every word matters with <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to escape the current floor while avoiding certain <strong>entities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert to your surroundings... even those you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>roguelike</strong> game where you collect coins to purchase cosmetics and other upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character customization included.</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Zeeentify"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/0a338c027c3c2b6ebb16c20cf42b162bbc53d622/header.jpg?t=1742822323","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116102,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116102/movie480.mp4?t=1742822321","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116102/movie_max.mp4?t=1742822321"},"name":"Random Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25711610